      "title": "Downloads",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Downloads\n\nPut all four files in `ComfyUI/models/mmaudio/`. Source: [Kijai/MMAudio_safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/MMAudio_safetensors)\n\n| Role | File (click = download) |\n|---|---|\n| MMAudio model | [mmaudio_large_44k_v2_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/MMAudio_safetensors/resolve/main/mmaudio_large_44k_v2_fp16.safetensors) |\n| Synchformer | [mmaudio_synchformer_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/MMAudio_safetensors/resolve/main/mmaudio_synchformer_fp16.safetensors) |\n| MMAudio VAE | [mmaudio_vae_44k_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/MMAudio_safetensors/resolve/main/mmaudio_vae_44k_fp16.safetensors) |\n| CLIP (feature) | [apple_DFN5B-CLIP-ViT-H-14-384_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/MMAudio_safetensors/resolve/main/apple_DFN5B-CLIP-ViT-H-14-384_fp16.safetensors) |\n\n**Custom node packs:** [ComfyUI-MMAudio](https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-MMAudio) (its requirements.txt includes `accelerate`), [ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite](https://github.com/Kosinkadink/ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite). Load / Save Video in this graph are core nodes.\n\nOne command from the repo root: `python scripts/frizzy.py doctor audio/ai-audio-maker`"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
